# Extracted from IBM's SDK by tools/extract.sh and tools/extract-langs.sh.
# The lifted C in lang/ is in the tree, so nothing here is needed to build.
analysis/
build/
.wine/
result
result-*
__pycache__/

# Thirteen megabytes written out of the transcription beside it by
# tools/delta-decompile.py, and rewritten whole by every change to that tool.
# `make rules' makes them. Numbered because one translation unit that size
# cannot be compiled on more than one core.
lang/*/delta_rules_c[0-9][0-9]_*.c
lang/*/delta_rules_c_*.c

# Local Windows toolchain (WinLibs mingw-w64 gcc), not part of the project.
.toolchain/
.venv/

# Wave files written into the working tree while listening to something.
# The ones that are evidence live in test/, under a name and a hash.
/*.wav
.freebuff/

# The Japanese language module, lifted by the commands in docs/japanese.md.
# It stays out of the tree until its romanizer can make an instance, because a
# module that cannot would fail any build that named it -- and most of it is
# nine megabytes of the romanizer's dictionary, written by tools/lift-rom.py.
lang/jajp/
